{"id":"wb-5-235","name":"边靖楼","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"边靖楼","text":"边靖楼，俗称鼓楼、谯楼，位于山西省代县上馆镇城中央十字街心，南立面正对南大街，北立面正对鼓楼后街。边靖楼曾是代州城的制高点，北望雁门、南俯滹沱，为三关防御体系指挥中心，具有重要的军事价值，被誉为”万里长城第一楼“。同时突出于旧城低平天际线中，气势磅礴，雄伟壮丽，古韵醇厚。现为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%BE%B9%E9%9D%96%E6%A5%BC","revisionId":93039394,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93039394","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d6f403a9dca5731a18409859.jpg","title":"代县边靖楼.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%BB%A3%E5%8E%BF%E8%BE%B9%E9%9D%96%E6%A5%BC.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c8/%E4%BB%A3%E5%8E%BF%E8%BE%B9%E9%9D%96%E6%A5%BC.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Redpipe","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"该照片的内容为中国全国重点文物保护单位。编号： CNSX-350-005","width":320,"height":238}}